Error: Jet.UnknownType: There's no type called `Înt`
  --> Tests/UI/dead_key_circumflex_type.jet:4:13
    |
  4 | bump: fn(x: Înt) {
    |             ^^^
 Why: On a keyboard layout where `^` is a dead key, `^` and the letter after it combine into one accented letter, so `^Int` was typed as `Înt`
 Fix: Write `^Int`; on a dead-key layout type `^` then a space, or switch to the layout's no-dead-keys variant
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.UnknownType

Error: Jet.ImmutableAssignment: `x` was made with `:`, so it can't change
  --> Tests/UI/dead_key_circumflex_type.jet:5:5
    |
  5 |     x += 1
    |     ^
 Why: Only `:=` bindings and parameters declared with the write mark `^` can be changed
 Fix: Declare it with `x := ...` instead
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.ImmutableAssignment
